{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122428","id":4282951618,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7_SKfC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122428","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122428.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122428.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122428","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122428/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122428/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122428/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1f5ce5fdf232891e1ceb3fdc705d08ce3f838cb7","number":122428,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add basic mouse camera controls template for CharacterBody3D","user":{"login":"xam3adev","id":305113226,"node_id":"U_kgDOEi-oig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305113226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev","html_url":"https://github.com/xam3adev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xam3adev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe existing CharacterBody3D movement template provides basic movement, gravity, and jumping, but there is no template that includes basic mouse camera controls.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new CharacterBody3D template with basic mouse-look functionality.\r\n\r\nThe template allows users to:\r\n\r\nRotate the character horizontally using mouse movement.\r\nRotate the camera vertically using mouse movement.\r\nLimit vertical camera rotation to prevent unnatural rotation.\r\nCapture the mouse when the game starts.\r\nAdjust mouse sensitivity.\r\n\r\nThis provides a more complete starting point for FPS/TPS-style 3D projects without requiring users to implement basic mouse camera controls themselves.\r\n\r\nAdditional information\r\n\r\nThe camera is expected to be a Camera3D child of the CharacterBody3D.\r\n\r\nThe template was written from scratch and tested in Godot to verify the movement, jumping, mouse-look, and mouse capture behavior.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":311852125,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTE4NTIxMjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20work","name":"needs work","description":"","color":"cc9999","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20tes